WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:11.550
Tom wanted to play hopscotch.

2
00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:17.799
"Let's play!" he called to Jim.

3
00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:25.130
So Tom hopped and Jim watched.

4
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:45.740
Then Jim hopped and Tom watched.

5
00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:52.430
Kate wanted to play too.

6
00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:56.352
"Let me play!" she begged.

7
00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:02.810
So Kate jumped and the boys watched.

8
00:01:13.952 --> 00:01:17.025
Joy wanted to play too.

9
00:01:17.492 --> 00:01:20.853
But she needed a bean bag.

10
00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.983
Kate tossed Joy a bean bag.

11
00:01:29.868 --> 00:01:33.666
"Let her play!" Kate shouted.

12
00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:42.570
So Joy jumped and everyone watched.

13
00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:47.095
"I win!" Joy cried.

14
00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:49.640
Everyone cheered.

